+# luchta-tsc-worker
+
+This is Luchta's vendored, patched copy of the TypeScript compiler. The
+patches add `luchta-tsc-worker`, a build worker that speaks Luchta's JSONL
+protocol, plus Yarn PnP resolution support.
+
+It is built from the Luchta repository, not from here:
+
+    cargo xtask build-worker --target <triple>
+
+See https://github.com/dobesv/luchta for the worker's source and
+documentation. Refer to https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript for the
+compiler's own documentation.
